./" Manpage for mcv 
.TH man 1 "26 August 2025" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME 
	mcv - mv a file, cd there, then edit it in vim (the copy not the original)
.SH SYNOPSIS
	mcv source destination
.SH DESCRIPTION
	does mv, cds to wherever it is now, then edits the file in vim
.SH OPTIONS
	mv default options work, so -i to prompt before overwrite, -n to not overwrite, -b to make backups, -u for update, -v for verbose
	vim default options do not work
.SH EXAMPLES
	mcv hi.csv csvs
	mcv sdifji.py ../../ijsdif/jsissbsbbsb.py
.SH BUGS
	probably none
